// The Streak: claimed once a local day from the menu's claim card (no run
// needed; GameMeta.claimStreak) and it continues the Streak; missing a day
// starts again at day 1. Day n pays
// STREAK_REWARDS[n - 1] gems, and every day after the table's end pays its
